BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventaarchwaystothepast3aafricanamericanhistorybustour24104-20260523@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260925T150806Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260523
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261025
SUMMARY:AARCHways to the Past: African American History Bus Tour
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a powerful and enlightening one hour journey aboard our vintage 1966 double-decker bus\, exploring the rich and often untold stories of Frederick’s African American community. In partnership with the African American Resources Cultural and Heritage Society (AARCH)\, this professionally guided tour will take you through historic neighborhoods\, landmarks\, and sites of significance\, highlighting the resilience\, culture\, and contributions of African Americans in Frederick from the 1800’s to today. Led by knowledgeable local guides\, you’ll hear firsthand accounts\, compelling narratives\, and inspiring histories that shaped the city’s identity and continue to resonate in the present. Discover Frederick’s past through voices that still echo today. TOUR HIGHLIGHTS: • Ride aboard a beautifully restored 1966 double-decker bus • Learn about Frederick’s African American history from AARCH docents • Visit important cultural landmarks and heritage sites • Engage with stories of strength\, resistance\, and community • A moving educational experience for all ages
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/aarchways-to-the-past%3a-african-american-history-bus-tour/24104/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventafricanamericanhistorywalkingtour15513-20260523@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260925T150806Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260523
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261025
SUMMARY:African American History Walking Tour
DESCRIPTION:Step into history with the AARCH Society Walking Tour! Led by tour guides from Frederick's Black Community who share first hand experiences and stories. Join us as we uncover the rich African American history\, stories\, landmarks\, and legacies that helped shape our community. Bring your walking shoes and experience Frederick through a powerful new authentic lens.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/african-american-history-walking-tour/15513/
END:VEVENT
