UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventlivemusicwithrocksteadysound26041-20260925@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260925T150806Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260925
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260926
SUMMARY:Live Music with Rock Steady Sound
DESCRIPTION:Rock Steady Sound is coming back to Sandbox with another all-star lineup for the books! Between Undertone’s mellow blues rock\, Zootu’s dynamic electropop\, and Jack Funk’s exciting funk rock\, you’re in in for quite a night of incredible local music. $10 cover at the door. All ages\, but anyone under 18 must be accompanied by a parent or guardian. See you at the show! Note: This event will be loud and high-energy. While we are always a pet- and family-friendly venue\, the volume might be a bit much for little ears and furry friends. Free earplugs are available at the bar!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/live-music-with-rock-steady-sound/26041/
END:VEVENT
