BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventalleynights23158-20260926@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260925T150806Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260926
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260927
SUMMARY:Alley Nights
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Alley Nights — your Saturday night destination in Downtown Frederick. With three bars open\, the party moves wherever the night takes you! Start in our newly renovated Main Bar\, catch the DJ spinning in Terrace\, or head upstairs to the rooftop bar for drinks and views of downtown Frederick. Add late-night bites\, great music\, and a lively crowd — and you’ve got everything you need for the perfect Saturday night! Benefactor Events joins us every first and third Saturday of the month to get the party going in Terrace! Meet us at Alley Nights! No cover | 21+ event.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/alley-nights/23158/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventancients26aliensgala22253-20260926@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260925T150806Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260926
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260927
SUMMARY:Ancients & Aliens Gala
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a prehistoric pseudoscience extravaganza! If you’ve attended the Delaplaine’s annual gala before\, you know they are anything but stuffy. Our over-the-top fundraiser this year features great food\, music and dancing\, open bar\, online silent auction\, and more. We’ll be celebrating our 40th year of visual arts education and raising funds to spread arts opportunities throughout the region.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/ancients-%26-aliens-gala/22253/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventautumnliqueurrelease11437-20260926@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260925T150806Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260926
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260927
SUMMARY:Autumn Liqueur Release
DESCRIPTION:Feel the crispness in the air? Craving somethin' a little hot and spicy? Just in time for our favorite fall release: Autumn Liqueur. And joining the party this year is the Pomegranate Apple Crush. Get ready\, Saturday\, September 26 from noon to 10 p.m. we'll be offering tastings\, full pours\, spirit tasting flights and cocktails made from your favorite fall elixir. We'll have an entirely new seasonal menu for you to try. Mark your calendars\, because this one won't last. Autumn Liqueur Description: Tenth Ward’s original apple brandy made from McCutcheon's apple cider\, melded with ginger\, plum\, black tea\, turmeric\, allspice\, cinchona bark\, sage\, fennel\, saffron\, and slightly sweetened with local honey. Tasting Notes: A smack of dry champagne\, bourbon-like innuendos and whispers of tart apple.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/autumn-liqueur-release/11437/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventbilateralartwithjessiebunk25934-20260926@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260925T150806Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260926
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260927
SUMMARY:Bilateral Art with Jessie Bunk
DESCRIPTION:Explore the creative possibilities of working with both hands at once in this playful\, beginner-friendly art workshop. Bilateral art uses repetitive movements on both sides of the body to encourage focus\, relaxation\, and imagination while creating. Students will experiment with a variety of bilateral art techniques\, including continuous-line drawing\, mark-making\, and pattern. Working with both hands encourages you to focus on the process rather than the finished product\, making this a relaxed and accessible way to explore creativity and stay present in the moment.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/bilateral-art-with-jessie-bunk/25934/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventdayofthefaeries23789-20260926@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260925T150806Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260926
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260927
SUMMARY:Day of the Faeries
DESCRIPTION:All things Faerie to celebrate the fall season. Visit all of the Fae stations for different activities and crafts. Dress up in your favorite wings and come to the park to play! (Price is per child\, and children must be accompanied by an adult).
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/day-of-the-faeries/23789/
