SUMMARY:LIVE! Infinity Tribe & Nester
DESCRIPTION:Three nationally touring jam powerhouses take over Frederick for a night of blissful debauchery! Frederick-rooted and nationally rising\, Natalie Brooke brings The Infinity Tribe home for a rare Frederick appearance. It's time to turn this town upside down! Frederick is about to be graced with a night of blissful funk fusion by three of Maryland's finest. Infinity Tribe & Nester at Carroll Creek Amphitheater - 5pm-10pm $15 tickets Join us for a night of amazing jams! Rain or shine.
