UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventalleynights23158-20261003@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260925T150806Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261003
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261004
SUMMARY:Alley Nights
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Alley Nights — your Saturday night destination in Downtown Frederick. With three bars open\, the party moves wherever the night takes you! Start in our newly renovated Main Bar\, catch the DJ spinning in Terrace\, or head upstairs to the rooftop bar for drinks and views of downtown Frederick. Add late-night bites\, great music\, and a lively crowd — and you’ve got everything you need for the perfect Saturday night! Benefactor Events joins us every first and third Saturday of the month to get the party going in Terrace! Meet us at Alley Nights! No cover | 21+ event.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/alley-nights/23158/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventfieldfreshfarmersmarket23988-20261003@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260925T150806Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261003
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261004
SUMMARY:Field Fresh Farmers Market
DESCRIPTION:Come visit the largest producer-only farmers market in Frederick County\, MD\, featuring over 30 local vendors! We're open every Saturday from April 25 to November 21\, 2026\, 9 am - 1 pm. See you there\, at the corner of E. Patrick St. & Franklin St.!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/field-fresh-farmers-market/23988/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventfrederickfarmersmarket25396-20261003@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260925T150806Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261003
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261004
SUMMARY:Frederick Farmers Market
DESCRIPTION:Frederick Farmer’s Market welcomes you every Saturday from 10AM to 1PM\, running from April 25 through November 21\, 2026. It's a delightful producer-only market where you can enjoy fresh\, local goodness. Cross streets: Butterfly Lane & Himes Ave.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/frederick-farmers-market/25396/
END:VEVENT
